FINDING 2 — Azure Hybrid Benefit not applied (licence cost)
Priority: 1 — do first. No performance impact, no owner negotiation, no testing.

What was observed
Filter Sheet5 column M (licenseType) for LicenseIncluded. Every one of these databases pays Microsoft for a SQL Server licence as a separate charge (column Y).

Visible from the screenshots:

Database	Environment	Licence cost/month
vos-iaz-sql-dev-datasyncs / vosiazsqldbdevndrdatasyncR2	DEV	£3,766.98
ctp-iaz-sql-sit-revaluation / ctpiazsqldbsitrevaluation	SIT	£188.35
ctp-iaz-sql-dev-revaluation / ctpiazsqldbdevrevaluation	DEV	£94.17
bstdevserver / fmeserver	DEV	£94.17
bst-iaz-sql-tst-geo / SWEET	TST	£94.17
vos-iaz-sql-sit-geo / SWEET	SIT	£94.17
(others — sum column Y for the full list)		
Why it costs money
Azure Hybrid Benefit allows an organisation that already owns SQL Server licences with active Software Assurance to apply them to Azure SQL, removing the licence charge entirely. The database, its performance and its configuration are unchanged — only the billing changes.

Note that Hybrid Benefit applies to Provisioned vCore databases. It does not apply to Serverless (whose licence is bundled into the per-second price) or to DTU tiers. That is why only a handful of databases carry this charge.

Recommendation
Confirm with the HMRC licensing or commercial contact whether eligible SQL Server licences with Software Assurance exist and can be allocated to non-production Azure use.
If yes, apply Hybrid Benefit to each LicenseIncluded database.
If the databases are deployed by Bicep, set licenseType: 'BasePrice' in the template rather than changing it in the portal.
Saving
Sum of column Y after the Part 1 fix. vosiazsqldbdevndrdatasyncR2 alone accounts for £3,766.98/month (~£45,200/year).

Confidence: High if eligible licences exist. Zero technical risk.

Steps
az sql db update -g <resource-group> -s <server> -n <database> \
  --license-type BasePrice
Or portal: database → Compute + storage → Save money → Yes, I have a SQL Server licence → Apply.

⚠️ Do not apply Hybrid Benefit without written licensing confirmation. Declaring licences you don't hold is a compliance issue, not just a cost one.

